  "description": "\"An Impressive Mews Townhouse in the Heart of Dublin 2\"\n\nBorgman Earls are delighted to present No. 1 Grattan Mews, a beautifully maintained and exceptionally inviting townhouse, ideally positioned along the charming St Stephen's Lane in the heart of Dublin 2.\n\nArranged over three levels, this impressive home offers bright, spacious and beautifully presented accommodation throughout. Originally constructed in the 1970s, the property has been thoughtfully upgraded over the years by its current owner and maintained to an exceptional standard.\n\nFrom the moment you step inside, there is a sense of warmth and comfort throughout, with carefully considered interiors, quality finishes and an excellent use of space.\n\nThe accommodation includes entrance hallway, leading to a generously proportioned double bedroom complete with storage and its own ensuite shower room, including shower, wash hand basin, WC & feature lighting & storage.\n\nStairs lead to what is undoubtedly one of the standout features of the property, a superb open-plan living, dining and kitchen area occupying the mid level.\n\nThis is a particularly impressive & inviting space, enhanced by three feature windows which allow wonderful natural light to fill the room. Beautiful solid wood flooring runs throughout, while the generous proportions provide ample room for both comfortable everyday living and entertaining.\n\nThe stylish, fully integrated kitchen is thoughtfully designed and fitted with a full complement of quality appliances, combining practicality with an attractive contemporary finish.\n\nOn the uppermost level, there are two further spacious double bedrooms, both benefiting from fitted wardrobes. The main bathroom is also contemporary in style & well presented and includes a bath with overhead shower, heated towel rail, feature lighting and excellent storage.\n\nAdditional features include gas-fired heating, a C2 BER rating and the benefit of one off-street parking space.\n\nContact us today to confirm a suitable viewing time.",
