  "description": "REA McGee are delighted to present No. 23 Mount Carmel Park to the market.\n\nExtending to approximately 108 sq. m., this attractive property offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, growing families, or those seeking a comfortable home in a well-established and convenient location.\n\nUpon entering, you are welcomed by a bright and inviting entrance hall, leading to a spacious living room. To the rear, the kitchen and dining area offers generous space for everyday family living and dining, with a family bathroom completing the downstairs accomadation. Upstairs comprises three well-proportioned bedrooms and the added benefit of an attic conversion.\n\nIdeally situated in Firhouse, No. 23 enjoys a superb location beside Dodder Park, where residents can enjoy scenic riverside walks along the River Dodder, an upgraded cycle track, a skatepark and a playground. The property is also conveniently positioned close to an excellent range of local amenities, including Knocklyon Shopping Centre, SuperValu, a selection of highly regarded primary and secondary schools, local GAA clubs, and various sporting facilities. The area is well serviced by public transport, with numerous bus routes providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre, Dún Laoghaire, Dundrum, and UCD. The property also benefits from easy access to the M50 via Junctions 11 and 12, making it an excellent choice for commuters.",
